{
    "article_summary": "The article describes a mild and efficient visible-light photoredox catalytic method for the direct N-(het)arylation of lactams. By generating N-centered lactam radicals from pyridinium-based precursors using 4CzIPN as an organic photocatalyst, the authors achieved regioselective C-N bond formation with various arenes and heteroarenes. The method is compatible with aqueous media and scalable under continuous flow conditions.",
